# crashed_ufo — a greyish vessel that came down hard: crashed_ship's saucer
# class (a round hull, 2-3 breaches, an inner cockpit, crew and a Commander
# who is the quest target when quest-backed). A thin wrapper, so scenarios
# and quest fixtures that stamp crashed_ufo build what they always did.
#
# Recommended footprint: 17×17 or larger.
function generate(x, y, w, h)
    set_param("class", "saucer")
    gen_structure("crashed_ship", x, y, w, h)
endfunction
